# Text files are stored and checked out with LF; PowerShell scripts are checked out with CRLF (Windows PowerShell
# 5.1 reads either, but Windows editors expect CRLF). Binary files are never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
